{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation milestone: RED regression test_parent_close_credits_duplicate_child_replacement_commit reproduced the parent close precheck failure when the only landed commit referenced a duplicate child's live replacement. Fix expands completion evidence scope from closed disposition tickets to their live replacements and descendants, without dropping the existing no-reference fail-closed protection. Targeted validation is green: pytest close subtree + completion gate + duration instrumentation (49 passed) and ruff check on changed files passed. File impact updated to actual changed paths."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788898199221309001,"uuid":"00916a96-f23d-44aa-91c7-f2c44ed033d2"}